   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Personal infinitive",
     "texto": [
      "When the infinitive has an expressed or different subject, it can agree: **É importante lermos o relatório** (it is important that we read the report). Its compound form expresses anteriority: **Depois de termos lido o relatório, decidimos** (after having read the report, we decided)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Periphrases",
     "texto": [
      "**Haver de + infinitive** expresses intention, expectation or commitment: **Hei de terminar o curso** (I'm going to finish the course). **Estar para + infinitive** indicates that something is about to happen: **A reunião está para começar** (the meeting is about to start). The meaning depends on context and the verb tense."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
